# The tooling here writes LF unconditionally (gen-index.py uses newline='\n').
# Without this, a Windows checkout with core.autocrlf=true converts to CRLF and
# every regeneration shows as modified even when the index is unchanged. That
# noise makes a genuine change indistinguishable from a phantom one.
*.md   text eol=lf
*.py   text eol=lf
*.sh   text eol=lf
